    "| \"Open my task list\", \"open the app\", \"it's not loading\" | `.claude/skills/open-the-app` |",
    "| \"Open my toolkit\", \"open the app\", \"open my task list\", \"it's not loading\" | `.claude/skills/open-my-toolkit` (it starts the one app every tool shares) |"
  ],
  [
    "| **http://localhost:4747** | The app. It opens on Home (a dashboard of boxes they arrange themselves), then the task list's pages: Tasks (Today, This week or All, as a Board, List or Calendar), Inbox, Review and Calls, plus Preferences (the cog). The Brain dump button at the top records a voice note. A small helper in `apps/server/` runs it on this computer. If it isn't running, use `.claude/skills/open-the-app` |\n| `Open Task List.html` | Double-clicking it goes to the link above when the task list is running |\n| `apps/task-list/` | The task list app. `CLAUDE.md` in there explains its data. Their tasks are in `apps/task-list/data/tasks.json` |",
    "| **http://localhost:4747** | The Small Business Toolkit app. It opens on Home (a dashboard of boxes they arrange themselves). The sidebar has a section for each of the 7 tools, then the Toolkit section. The Brain dump button at the top records a voice note. A small helper in `apps/server/` runs it on this computer. If it isn't running, use `.claude/skills/open-my-toolkit` |\n| `Open Small Business Toolkit.html` | Double-clicking it goes to the link above when the toolkit is running |\n| `apps/task-list/` | The Task List OS app, 1 of the 7 tools: Tasks (Today, This week or All, as a Board, List or Calendar), Inbox, Review and Calls, plus Preferences (the cog). `CLAUDE.md` in there explains its data. Their tasks are in `apps/task-list/data/tasks.json` |"
